  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "To compute $a-b,$ we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a-b & =⟨2,-1⟩-⟨-1,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2-(-1),-1-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,-3⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
